// Synthetic fixtures for the README screenshot harness.
//
// Nothing in here is real user data. Names, cities, bios, interests and
// avatars are invented for promotional renders only; the avatar images are
// abstract brand-coloured monograms generated by `make_fixtures.py`, never
// photographs of a person.
//
// This file is tooling: it is not part of the shipped app and is not
// collected by `flutter test` (which only runs `test/`).

